{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare for Cannons-Blasted Glory!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to KALE: Grakonian Campaign. A 2D arcade-style spaceship game that feels like it time-warped straight outta 1984.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras/9faee780bf73d7511339eaae311dffb8.avif?t=1762385873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras_big/9faee780bf73d7511339eaae311dffb8.webp?t=1762385873 width=1560 height=757 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KALE is a side-scrolling, neon-drenched, voice-acted sci-fi space shooter with a full-blown original story about big ugly aliens, cosmic criminals, lunar loves and one renegade pilot with a license to pew-pew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras/a4023ad31c4aaafaa2053bd2da6f262f.avif?t=1762385873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras_big/a4023ad31c4aaafaa2053bd2da6f262f.webp?t=1762385873 width=1560 height=859 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Kale Starborn, a sarcastic and cheeky anti-hero with a mysterious past, and a ship named &quot;The Justiceblaster&quot; (because subtlety is for Earthlings).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission? Save Moon22F from the evil mega-corporation of the Grakonians\u2014who are totally not a parody of every 80s villain conglomerate ever. Pinky promise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras/eb3b8ea4971d6d10fda414009d22da67.avif?t=1762385873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras_big/eb3b8ea4971d6d10fda414009d22da67.webp?t=1762385873 width=1560 height=856 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5Voice acting that's so passionate, you\u2019ll swear it\u2019s a radio drama in space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5A full original story written like your favorite B-movie sci-fi flick\u2014campy, dramatic, and surprisingly emotional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras/e2a4d6636f55ba98b854109328cb7bfa.avif?t=1762385873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras_big/e2a4d6636f55ba98b854109328cb7bfa.webp?t=1762385873 width=1560 height=857 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5Orchestral, Country and Synthwave soundtrack that makes your heart race and your mustache grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5Hand-crafted concept art that glows with radioactive charm and laser beam love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras/95715689eeea8f3e0c9b9fdc5694d57b.avif?t=1762385873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras_big/95715689eeea8f3e0c9b9fdc5694d57b.webp?t=1762385873 width=1560 height=854 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras/b5b2b0c399c6288281166acb970369c3.avif?t=1762385873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras_big/b5b2b0c399c6288281166acb970369c3.webp?t=1762385873 width=1560 height=857 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play KALE today!</strong> Because the future won\u2019t save itself. But Kale Starborn might.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras/b87e0cf6a9df914f56c2fb028c03c2a9.avif?t=1762385873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras_big/b87e0cf6a9df914f56c2fb028c03c2a9.webp?t=1762385873 width=1560 height=854 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060850?t=1762385873","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/dd0b51ae610586d6df42818cd0ee565225b6760a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762385873","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/bd13e0ac91c3ee259608492823c1e666067f97fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762385873","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/bd13e0ac91c3ee259608492823c1e666067f97fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762385873","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare for Cannons-Blasted Glory!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to KALE: Grakonian Campaign. A 2D arcade-style spaceship game that feels like it time-warped straight outta 1984.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras/9faee780bf73d7511339eaae311dffb8.avif?t=1762385873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060850/extras_big/9faee780bf73d7511339eaae311dffb8.webp?t=1762385873 width=1560 height=757 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KALE is a side-scrolling, neon-drenched, voice-acted sci-fi space shooter with a full-blown